<title>USA: St Joseph hogs $1.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs $1.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JOSEPH 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.50</p>
<p>higher. Top $61.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3	230-270 lbs    60.50-61.00</p>
<p>US 2-3	270-290 lbs    59.00-60.00</p>
<p>US 2-4	290-310 lbs    57.00-58.00</p>
<p>Sows:  Under 550 lbs steady; over 500 lbs 0.50 higher. Top 51.00.US 1-2	300-500 lbs    50.00</p>
<p>US 1-3	500-550 lbs    50.50</p>
<p>		550-700 lbs    51.00</p>
</text>
